      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MELFIELD SORYT (9) has recorded two wins and three minor placings from the past five starts. Was again in sparkling form last start when she scored over 2260m at Bathurst, getting home by a nose. Will need an ounce of luck to slot in from this tricky draw. Meets some better types this time but another win is on the cards. FLO RYDA NZ (2) found a spot near the tail of the field off the second line and couldn't come into contention when ninth last start over 1720m at this track. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this better draw. Taking on a better field but he is capable of running a much better race. POLLY PUT KETTLEON (8) didn't do a bad job when sixth over 1720m at this track last time out. Each-way chance. NOTHINGBUTWAVES (3) disappointed last time when eighth over 1720m at this track. Can bounce back to top-three form.",
